WEBVTT

00:41:27.974 --> 00:41:30.346
suddenly we discover
we've got these machines

00:41:30.370 --> 00:41:32.533
who may have goals
that we don't understand."

00:41:32.557 --> 00:41:35.268
This is not what
you worry about, in terms of AI.

00:41:35.292 --> 00:41:38.426
Could you explain
why you don't worry about this?

00:41:38.784 --> 00:41:44.633
KFL: If we look at what is going to take
to have all the human capabilities,

00:41:44.657 --> 00:41:47.299
many, many more breakthroughs
are going to be needed.

00:41:47.323 --> 00:41:51.799
Today's AIs are basically
pattern-recognition engines

00:41:51.823 --> 00:41:54.601
that are tools under our control.

00:41:54.625 --> 00:41:59.220
And for these tools to grow
into something as powerful as people,

00:41:59.244 --> 00:42:00.783
or even more powerful,